From eac841296f1b690cb8c833a945873199bd147dd7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 21:49:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] MFront: behaviour variables, models and porous flows usable
 in device code

- behaviour variables: default constructors of the behaviour and of its
  data classes and behaviour variable factories are host and device
  functions; in device code, parameters take their default values
- StandardElastoViscoPlasticity brick: device compatible failure of the
  staggered scheme of the porosity, yield radius defined by data usable
  in device code
- fix the name of the derivative of the yield radius interpolated by
  cubic splines when an identifier is used
- generic model interface: the class implementing a model is written by
  writeGenericModelClass, which can also generate a class usable in
  device code
- fix models with material properties and parameters treated as static
  variables, and static variables of models using quantities
---
 .../MFront/BehaviourCodeGeneratorBase.hxx     |   9 +
 .../include/MFront/GenericModelInterface.hxx  |  50 ++
 mfront/src/BehaviourCodeGeneratorBase.cxx     | 169 ++++---
 mfront/src/DataIsotropicHardeningRule.cxx     |  10 +-
 mfront/src/GenericModelInterface.cxx          | 468 ++++++++++--------
 .../StandardElastoViscoPlasticityBrick.cxx    |  13 +-
 6 files changed, 451 insertions(+), 268 deletions(-)

